    "description": "This Outer Richmond duplex spans 3,050 sq ft and offers light, space, and flexibility in a prime San Francisco location. Each unit has 2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom, with bright living rooms framed by oversized windows and classic hardwood floors. One bedroom on each level opens to a private balcony overlooking the backyard. The ground level includes a large garage with space for multiple cars plus bonus area great for a home office or additional storage. A low-maintenance backyard provides just the right amount of greenery without extra work. With one unit vacant, the property is move-in ready - live in one and rent the other, lease both, or explore expansion. Conveniently located near shops, restaurants, public transit, parks and the beach, this property offers a perfect balance of city living and outdoor access."
